    const valuationStartedAt = collectPerformanceBreakdown ? featureClockNow() : 0;
    // 估值（T24 转正：用户 11-17「达标就转正」「转正后直接删掉旧估值」）: every decision — every role, every nesting (an
    // initialization branch, a summon's cooperative forecast) — ranks its candidates by their R20 value (r20Shadow: the
    // decision's fact table and its race; nothing is previewed, advanced or cloned inside the valuation). A candidate the
    // pipeline excludes for its targets or for changing nothing (R16, R17) is not valued (0). A worker's share (R11) brings
    // the values of its candidates (parallelPlan.given).
    // 认输与撤离: leaving is valued apart (r20Shadow, BattlePreview exitValuation: against fighting on), so it starts from
    // what letting this action go by is worth to the race (the PASS_OPPORTUNITY candidate's R20 value, when there is one) —
